YAML dates (Date) are not supported in Spinel's psych
YAML timestamps (Time) are not supported in Spinel's psych
loading a Regexp from YAML is not supported in Spinel's psych
loading a Foo from YAML is not supported in Spinel's psych
loading a Psych::Set from YAML is not supported in Spinel's psych
YAML tag !ruby/encoding (an Encoding) is not supported in Spinel's psych
YAML tag !!omap (a Psych::Omap) is not supported in Spinel's psych
Psych.safe_load(freeze: true) is not supported in Spinel's psych
a collection as a mapping key is not supported in Spinel's psych dump
Psych.dump of a Range is not supported in Spinel's psych
